Arithmetic Operators
+ → Addition
- → Subtraction
* → Multiplication
/ → Division
% → Remainder

Relational Operators
== → Equal to
!= → Not equal
> → Greater than
< → Less than
>= → Greater or equal
<= → Less or equal

Logical Operators
&& → AND
|| → OR
! → NOT

Bitwise Operators
& → Bitwise AND
| → Bitwise OR
^ → Bitwise XOR
~ → Bitwise NOT
<< → Left shift
>> → Right shift
>>> → Unsigned right shift

Assignment Operators
= → Assign value
+= → Add and assign
-= → Subtract and assign
*= → Multiply and assign
/= → Divide and assign
%= → Modulus and assign

Unary Operators
+ → Positive
- → Negative
++ → Increment
-- → Decrement

Ternary Operator
?: → Conditional operator